## Finish
Stop owned background tools with `fulcrum task terminal stop {{thread}} --all-owned --json`, then run `fulcrum finish --bead {{bead}} --thread-id {{thread}} --ownership-operation {{ownership_operation}} --outcome approved --input - --json` with `summary`, exact `source_oid`, `checks`, and `evidence`. Use `blocked` only with concrete attempts and required action.
